The Civic Reporting App demonstrates the development and deployment of a complete full-stack web application.

The project combines **React, Vite, Python, Django, Django REST Framework, and a relational database** to provide a platform for reporting and managing civic issues.

Beyond building the application itself, the project provided practical experience with **API integration, database management, authentication, file handling, environment configuration, debugging, and production deployment**.

The application is currently deployed and available online:

